  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On 18/11/2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing submitted on 18/11/2025 and numbered Site location plan, block plan, proposed plan, ordnance survey map, compliance statement was not lawful because:\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E, and Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 because the proposed outbuilding contains primary living accommodation and as such is not incidental to the main dwelling. Furthermore, it is unclear why a second outbuilding is reasonably required for purposes incidental to the enjoyment of the house when considered in conjunction with the existing c.24 square metre outbuilding already in place within the rear garden.\r\n"
